add table inet boxpanel_traffic
add chain inet boxpanel_traffic output { type filter hook output priority mangle; policy accept; }
add chain inet boxpanel_traffic input { type filter hook input priority mangle; policy accept; }
add counter inet boxpanel_traffic up_u1
add counter inet boxpanel_traffic down_u1
add rule inet boxpanel_traffic output meta l4proto { tcp, udp } meta mark 0xb7000001 ct mark set meta mark counter name up_u1
add rule inet boxpanel_traffic input meta l4proto { tcp, udp } ct direction reply ct mark 0xb7000001 counter name down_u1
add counter inet boxpanel_traffic up_u2
add counter inet boxpanel_traffic down_u2
add rule inet boxpanel_traffic output meta l4proto { tcp, udp } meta mark 0xb7000002 ct mark set meta mark counter name up_u2
add rule inet boxpanel_traffic input meta l4proto { tcp, udp } ct direction reply ct mark 0xb7000002 counter name down_u2
